# Shipment: `floor 3 service elevator`, `take cart`, `enter upper loading dock`, `approach dock manager`; back via `floor 1 service elevator`, `enter tech center` (Klyne scene) and `approach games` / `status` / `terminal display` / `accessories display` / `television display` / `cuff display` with `use box of X on Y` (cart cannot ride the escalator, tool box picked up on floor 2); `use cart on hallway`; Ewey in the service corridor; Arcade fix with `use box of tools on out of order game platform`; tool box back with `use box of tools on hallway`; storage area (Porto promotes Ewey) and the street. Old man: answer the three riddles (An old man, Crazy, An Elite then I'm not sure), I'd like to be alone, Head to the subway; Help the man at the butcher shop; Travel to Centrino District.
